{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given the set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d98ffe996c0f0d3b82b284cba2113439fefea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />, of which one is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/d/1fde1adcefa35a8828d3c8eaae0d8f30543be287.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - (1/n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"20\" />, and all the others are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The arithmetic mean of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> numbers is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f77f19c644ba0bba93b0721166b38347684400e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ n - \\frac{1}{n} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ n - \\frac{1}{n^2} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1 - \\frac{1}{n^2} \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1 - \\frac{1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"563\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/b/6db1ca54d89afb3e0bcb5a8f98b0e1680cf08c69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1(n-1)+(1-\\frac{1}{n})}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"147\" height=\"40\" />. You get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f5566219e8863890af0ef9fa9bac20553cd9ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n-1+1-\\frac{1}{n}}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" />, which is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/f/d9f1ef37e9fbcdf6f38b158a386dc538f809070a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n-\\frac{1}{n}}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"47\" height=\"40\" />, which is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1962 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1962\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>Problem 7</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href